Z||000000||fiero56||07-21-2001||04:52 PM||||Engine is a 2.8 going .060" over<P>-Cam- High Energy, hydraulic flat tappet<BR> CompCams(k-kit) <BR> price- $300 for kit<BR> part# K16-232-4(grind# 252H)<BR> valve lift with 1.5 rocker:<BR> intake- .425<BR> exhaust- .425<BR> duration:<BR> intake- 252<BR> exhaust- 206<BR> lobe separation-110*<BR>-Rockers/Pushrods- CompCams(rp-kit)<BR> price- $148<BR> part#- RP1413-12<BR> magnum roller rockers(1.52 ratio)<BR> High Energy pushrods 5/16"x6.163"<BR>-Pistons- KB silv-o-lite<BR> price- $168(set of 8, only need 6)<BR> part#- 1463<BR> specs later(I can't find my sheet)<P>Need recommendations/part #s:<BR>-ARP main, rod, & head fasterners- <BR>-valves<BR>-piston rings<BR>-fel-pro gasket set<P>Anything major I'm forgetting?<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 07-21-2001).]||||reg||5
